OL,3,GNEWSATheft accused trio claim King's
OL,4,Alambs were rescued
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree women accused of stealing three
OL,7,Flambs from a farm on a royal estate
OL,8,Ftold police they believed King Charles
OL,9,FIII "would have consented to their
OL,10,Frescue", a court has heard.
OL,12,FSarah Foy, 26, Rose Patterson, 37, and
OL,13,FRosa Sharkey, 26, are on trial charged
OL,14,Fwith theft, following an incident in
OL,15,FMay 2023 in Sandringham, Norfolk.
OL,17,FThe members of campaign group Animal
OL,18,FRising appeared on Tuesday at Norwich
OL,19,FCrown Court, where a jury heard they
OL,20,Fhad told police they could not give the
OL,21,Flambs back because it would "expose
OL,22,Fthem to unlawful welfare standards".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
