OL,3,GNEWSATheft accused trio claim King's
OL,4,Alambs were rescued
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe three defendants handed themselves
OL,7,Fin to Windsor police station the day
OL,8,Fafter the lambs were taken on 24 May,
OL,9,Fbut deny charges of theft.
